# TRT V2 Launch Roadmap — Decision & Governance Master Note

## Purpose

This document defines the current state, remaining roadmap, architectural priorities, risk zones, and strategic 
decisions required to evolve TRT V2 from a validated semantic bridge runtime into a launchable Unity ↔ Web/App 
ecosystem within the next 3–6 months.

This note acts as:

* Decision framework
* Governance checklist
* Architectural alignment document
* Execution roadmap
* Scope-control system
* Runtime safety guide
* Semantic engine evolution tracker

---

# 1. CURRENT STATE — WHAT IS ALREADY BUILT

## Core Monorepo Foundation ✅

### Status

Stable and operational.

### Built

* Turborepo orchestration
* pnpm workspace architecture
* typed package boundaries
* centralized contract ownership
* clean dependency graph
* shared governance structure
* workspace package exports
* runtime-safe Vercel deployment
* CI guardrails
* smoke validation pipelines

### Decision

TRT remains the canonical contract owner.

No external repo may independently redefine:

* bridge contracts
* runtime event schemas
* semantic runtime meaning
* Unity action contracts

