### 13. Stability & Scaling

#### Needs

* runtime monitoring
* telemetry dashboards
* rollback systems
* deployment stability

#### Challenges

* concurrency
* runtime debugging
* infrastructure cost

#### Decision

Operational stability becomes equal priority to feature velocity.

---

### 14. Mobile/App Strategy

## Decision Required

Choose primary direction:

* Web-first
* Unity-native
* PWA
* React Native shell

#### Risk

Fragmented runtime architecture.

