# 9. STRATEGIC SUMMARY

TRT V2 is evolving into:

```text
Semantic Operating System
+
Governed Runtime Engine
+
Cross-Platform Progression Layer
+
Unity/Web Semantic Bridge
```

rather than:

* a normal app
* a normal game
* a normal CRM
* a normal dashboard

The architecture must therefore prioritize:

* governance
* determinism
* replayability
* semantic clarity
* runtime safety
* orchestration discipline

before aggressive feature expansion.
